 "structural_change": "S81-SLICE (stream 0cm, owner-approved DV p4): new beat sub-leaf of the distributed-vector slice (SU lane engine, helper S81-SLICE-SU); flop-first pins, die hold budget. RTL-BUILD-S81 10-18: + op 14 ENG (Engram mix feeder of the beat's ve sub-leaf: 4 kb h stash, gate latch, write-back) and the ve / e / g seams. S81-SLICE/CHILD 10-21 w2: re-close on current RTL (8158a1e89 SW wr/wsel weight-row path, MUT 9; the closed b571a8c2c view predates it; no RTL change here); outline 172.8x172.8; io_hold_margin 0.03; + slvs_mut9 bench. ELEM-XFV/VS 10-21 n32f: SRAM h-stash (8x ot_sram_1r1w_32x128_m1, OT_S81SL_VS_SRAM) + FP_N32 leaves (OT_S81SL_VS_FP_N32) + native-32 control copies (kept capture flags, shared ENG prequal, regional busy/ka copies); no new cycles. FALLBACK: same source, 216 x 237.6 (+22% area, lower util)",
